<title>USA: Cambridge, Mass., won by BayBank.</title>
<headline>Cambridge, Mass., won by BayBank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BayBank said it won $9.905 million of Caambridge, Mass., municipal purpose limited tax loan of 1996 bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.4971 percent.</p>
</text>
